---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
---
<Tunnel title="Step 3 — Format the USB | Save My Gig!" status="Critical_Path · Recovery" red>
  <div class="step-label">Step 3 of 5</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">USB format</h2>

  <p>Formatting prepares the drive so the CDJ can read it.</p>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Use your system's default tool, or right-click the USB drive → <strong>Format</strong>.</li>
    <li>Format: <span class="mono">FAT32</span> (if available) or <span class="mono">exFAT</span></li>
    <li>Name: <span class="mono">SAVEMYGIG</span> (or anything you like)</li>
    <li>Quick format: OK</li>
    <li>Scheme: <span class="mono">Master Boot Record (MBR)</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="panel panel-warn">
    <p style="margin:0">⚠️ <strong>Do not remove the USB during formatting.</strong></p>
  </div>

  <p class="question">Has the USB been successfully formatted?</p>

  <a href="/protocol/critical/copy-back" class="btn btn-go" data-event="step_completed" data-step="format" data-answer="yes">
    🟢 Yes — USB is formatted
  </a>
  <a href="/protocol/critical/usb-dead" class="btn btn-stop" data-event="step_completed" data-step="format" data-answer="no">
    🔴 No — the format fails
  </a>
</Tunnel>
